cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vec-license-atlas: a three-layer license atlas for virtual-cell and virtual-embryo work (code / weights / data)"
abstract: "A three-layer license atlas: for 27 projects in the virtual-cell and virtual-embryo ecosystem the code license, the model-weight license and the data terms are recorded separately, each row carrying an evidence URL, a detection method and a check date. Seven widespread misreadings are corrected against primary text. Ships a zero-dependency query CLI, a rebuild and invariant checker, and seven tests that run without pytest."
authors:
